{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_034ayu01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_034ayu01_title", "source_sha256": "b51f6aeda15ca520d1e848f7f457e8189952d3494de0bb1286015501cffb4c63", "ja": "歩とおでかけ1", "zh": "与步外出1", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_034ayu01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_034ayu01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2b95ac5e27a6297e858cd5dfffb3dd92de2dd4299f1eda8285e502ec04788b17", "ja": "歩とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和步一起外出时的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_034ayu01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_034ayu01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d747247babce8b3c983629d667f6413b746c341940827d4740f7cdb11793d97b", "ja": "（島根ゆかりの作家、小泉八雲。怪談を多く残した\n彼にちなんだイベントで、歩が挑戦する仕事は……）", "zh": "（岛根县的作家小泉八云。他留下了许多怪谈作品，以他为主题的活动中，步要挑战的工作是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_034ayu01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_034ayu01_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "323d40e3694691c912626061c149e545a88222ac73170bc668dfe60efbc683ef", "ja": "無理無理無理！　アタシ怖いのマジ無理なんだって！\n怪談の朗読なんて……マイガーッ！！", "zh": "不行不行不行！我真的最怕恐怖的东西了！\n朗读怪谈什么的……天哪——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_034ayu01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_034ayu01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7d49889778a07ced84f27f07a3a314bd72891b79e006f37dde300ece4bdad006", "ja": "そう言わず……ここはひとつ、挑戦してくれないか？\n頼む、歩！", "zh": "别这么说……就当是帮个忙，挑战一下吧？\n拜托了，步！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_034ayu01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_034ayu01_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f83fdafa2130b29d760f466ebcf2a094296edf19a9e29364a46ee767cf6d6881", "ja": "絶対無理！　まず台本読めない！　ほんと勘弁して！\nうう、考えるだけで……マイガーッ！！", "zh": "绝对不行！首先我连剧本都看不懂！真的饶了我吧！呜呜，光是想想就……天啊——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_034ayu01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_034ayu01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "58b3f7c445fc22868c66acbb63da27d77534a3679315449d4c38a9b70300e205", "ja": "そ、そうか……。残念だが仕方がない。\nなら、ここは俺が出演しよう！", "zh": "这、这样啊……。真遗憾，但也没办法。既然如此，就由我来出演吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_034ayu01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_034ayu01_1005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "022a5cea110ccb6d66397076a9c6c0682fb49422756e940de92d8aa742666b6a", "ja": "えっ？　{$P$}が？\n『アイドル・ちょいこわ☆怪談ナイト♪』に……！？", "zh": "诶？{$P$}先生要上？\n要参加《偶像·微恐☆怪谈之夜♪》……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_034ayu01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_034ayu01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "63b3e0cd1c3c9cb926a379963c41df1bb52d68b32a1b133ab81a5375e73ee920", "ja": "ああ、仕方がない。今日は俺が……アイドルだ！", "zh": "啊，没办法。今天就由我来……当偶像吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_034ayu01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_034ayu01_1008_034ayu", "source_sha256": "58a73bbb26e5daaa77a8f39a95afb65adfc7a43b9ee9d6cfaea227c864530018", "ja": "わ、わかったよ！　やる！　やるよ！\nだってさ、さすがに無理があるじゃん、それは……。", "zh": "我、我知道了！我做！我做就是了！\n因为那样的话，实在是太勉强了吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_034ayu01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_034ayu01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "643ee0f559a89cd055156f7b7a84877f5a9c7e0a6519b1ef73210b1fd095dae5", "ja": "いや、無理なんてない！　今日の俺は、人間の限界を\n超えてみせるッ！　しかと見ていてくれ！", "zh": "不，才没有做不到的事！今天的我，就要超越人类的极限给你看！可要好好看着啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_034ayu01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_034ayu01_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "98990a078f27f29d8c8f1d4b791e5b884ef5444739fe0259e2e4536127921f0a", "ja": "ぷっ……！　ふ、あは、あははははっ！　　あーもう、\n{$P$}が笑わせるから……！", "zh": "噗……！呃、啊哈哈哈哈！真是的，都是因为{$P$}逗我笑……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_034ayu01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_034ayu01_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7c13de99d587ab18b132a67e1d6f4068afc055311fd9165b2c6ff2d9e658dd17", "ja": "でも、お陰で勇気出たよ。\nがんばるから、ちゃんと聞いててよね！", "zh": "不过，多亏了你，我鼓起勇气了。\n我会加油的，所以要好好听着哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_034ayu01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_034ayu01_1012_p", "source_sha256": "ddd10131508f0f94fc23bff88c2273db58a316ce0a2bfbf1523710f1a945ea7c", "ja": "歩……！　ああ、もちろんだ！", "zh": "步……！啊，当然了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_034ayu01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_034ayu01_1013_p", "source_sha256": "3a383c7aa16b63d1962290b6ec64323f0dec4adb9596be43834faecc7d16762e", "ja": "（その後のイベントでは、明るい歩の真剣な朗読が、\nかえって怖いと好評だった……。やったな、歩！）", "zh": "（之后的活动中，开朗的步认真朗读的样子反而让人觉得可怕，获得了好评……干得漂亮，步！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
